    @* These twelve have no honest position on a drawing of the car's outside, so they are plain
       buttons rather than invented hotspots that would be harder to find. Fenderliners (inside
       the wheel arch) and bumper slides (mounting brackets behind the bumper cover) joined the
       original six for the same reason. *@
    <div class="car-extras">
        @foreach (var part in new[] {
            Part.Interior, Part.EngineBay, Part.LoadArea, Part.Odometer, Part.Undercarriage, Part.Other,
            Part.FenderlinerFrontLeft, Part.FenderlinerFrontRight,
            Part.BumperSlideFrontLeft, Part.BumperSlideFrontRight,
            Part.BumperSlideRearLeft, Part.BumperSlideRearRight
